{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-10","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：五边形与六边形与十边形","englishTitle":"If an equilateral pentagon be inscribed in a circle, the square on the side of the pentagon is equal to the squares on the side of the hexagon and on that of the decagon inscribed in the same circle.","book":13,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","contentId":"euclid-13-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c6916636efefb4d84aac35ea3efc790b4bf9e7d8ccaa92807fe1a9ba785b626","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-10.statement","euclid-13-10.construction.1","euclid-13-10.proof.1","euclid-13-10.construction.2","euclid-13-10.proof.2","euclid-13-10.proof.3","euclid-13-10.proof.4","euclid-13-10.proof.5","euclid-13-10.proof.6","euclid-13-10.proof.7","euclid-13-10.proof.8","euclid-13-10.proof.9","euclid-13-10.proof.10","euclid-13-10.proof.11","euclid-13-10.proof.12","euclid-13-10.proof.13","euclid-13-10.proof.14","euclid-13-10.proof.15","euclid-13-10.proof.16","euclid-13-10.proof.17","euclid-13-10.proof.18","euclid-13-10.proof.19","euclid-13-10.proof.20","euclid-13-10.proof.21","euclid-13-10.proof.22","euclid-13-10.conclusion","euclid-13-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"712bd39f97bd7a4a6d1ac3541eca2a906b6f91c556d829d20f517f8e41724f4b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an equilateral pentagon be inscribed in a circle, the square on the side of the pentagon is equal to the squares on the side of the hexagon and on that of the decagon inscribed in the same circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在圆内刻上等边的五边形,则五边的正方形等于六边形的正方形,而同一圆内则等于十边形的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a8288317efbe8954f60a67f0fd87cfcd6eb98fea5dcd798fb75063359ed60f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCDE be a circle, and let the equilateral pentagon ABCDE be inscribed in the circle ABCDE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCDE成为圆,让等边的五角形ABCDE在ABCDE圆中刻上。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5df1b170c15ac4f1fb5464455e0076387b2ebf82a664f62660f8bbd1c1544910","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the square on the side of the pentagon ABCDE is equal to the squares on the side of the hexagon and on that of the decagon inscribed in the circle ABCDE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,五角形ABCDE的正方形等于六角形和ABCDE圆内10角的正方形等于。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e9ac7349b13fe14359d8c45ecf72f5ccaf469fd3e2e40492734d0d97be4ebcd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the centre of the circle, the point F, be taken, let AF be joined and carried through to the point G, let FB be joined, let FH be drawn from F perpendicular to AB and be carried through to K, let AK, KB be joined, let FL be again drawn from F perpendicular to AK, and be carried through to M, and let KN be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将圆的中心,即F点,连接到AF点,然后传送到G点,连接到FB点,连接到FH点,连接到F直肠,连接到K直肠,连接到AK直肠,连接到FL直肠,连接到M直肠,连接到KN。（相关点与线段：AB、KB）"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"949e0e4876d68a843d5a94d010b6d1482669a05912540bfc26a86668d65577a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since the circumference ABCG is equal to the circumference AEDG, and in them ABC is equal to AED, therefore the remainder, the circumference CG, is equal to the remainder GD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于环形ABCG等于环形AEDG,其中ABC等于AED,因此其余部分,环形CG等于其余的GD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9495433ee2ba00083c6990c65069f24f777f684ff878846740892cf0cd131438","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CD belongs to a pentagon; therefore CG belongs to a decagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CD属于五角形,因此CG属于十角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7e8e76660daf1c0d6d8d2485d51ff5bf52d3d896cfc95bddb69b72fe2bce77b","citations":["euclid-1-5","euclid-1-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since FA is equal to FB, and FH is perpendicular, therefore the angle AFK is also equal to the angle KFB. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5), [I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FA等于FB,FH是垂直的,因此,AFK的角度也等于KFB的角度 [ [I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5) [I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85ce7698f601971bf50a06d324db6a76975c4d0b7672be9103cdb27159eb1c7d","citations":["euclid-3-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence the circumference AK is also equal to KB; [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)] therefore the circumference AB is double of the circumference BK; therefore the straight line AK is a side of a decagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,环形AK也等于KB;因此,环形AB是环形BK的两倍;因此,直线AK是十角的一面。 [[III. 26](/principles/euclid-3-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f50d50105ecf3ecf6eb43e97b29d0a8f3b89af491458bb59ae775f868ac53742","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason AK is also double of KM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,AK也是KM的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56f8a38549f6352a9063268f7b07cfa1524bf2666721d24ea177757a388a7a6f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the circumference AB is double of the circumference BK, while the circumference CD is equal to the circumference AB, therefore the circumference CD is also double of the circumference BK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于环形AB是环形BK的两倍,而环形CD等于环形AB,因此环形CD也是环形BK的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae2798a10b0d3bea34b37bba885ba924e0da1f9e5adcaec9b686b7141e6ce2a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the circumference CD is also double of CG; therefore the circumference CG is equal to the circumference BK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但环形CD也是CG的两倍,因此环形CG等于环形BK。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"645422cbb8e01b8947423c064ee37049b411380e6124dcaf367d61b5268cbe1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BK is double of KM, since KA is so also; therefore CG is also double of KM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BK是KM的两倍,因为KA也是这样;因此CG也是KM的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8363bad97ba923b353d27cdaa6275c75683195802567cc4f6027ec22096812b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, the circumference CB is also double of the circumference BK, for the circumference CB is equal to BA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,另外,环形CB也是环形BK的两倍,因为环形CB等于BA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6fc484221bdf055da0794e497f81648ac54bddacc6026d723628c87db0a4089","citations":["euclid-6-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the whole circumference GB is also double of BM; hence the angle GFB is also double of the angle BFM. [[VI. 33](/principles/euclid-6-33)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,整个环形GB也是BM的两倍;因此,角度GFB也是角度BFM的两倍。 [[VI. 33](/principles/euclid-6-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"05ff37a9caf6065039b9dc10ad00f7fb3894ed3d089f1e94fb45e6d35e73f7df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle GFB is also double of the angle FAB, for the angle FAB is equal to the angle ABF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GFB角也是FAB角的两倍,FAB角等于ABF角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a21343fdfb789eeb6cd830596a097473740f7acf617b1d8d65a2b28ed5052a7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle BFN is also equal to the angle FAB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BFN角也等于FAB角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7524ade07f1c76195833489181e4d6f0e4cb9d6caedd7f27f820dc3ade86aeca","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ABF is common to the two triangles ABF and BFN; therefore the remaining angle AFB is equal to the remaining angle BNF; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the triangle ABF is equiangular with the triangle BFN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABF角是两个三角形的常见角度,即ABF和BFN角;因此,其余的AFB角等于其余角度BNF;因此,ABF角三角形与三角形BFN的等角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e65eed3b8dc8e0fe05fc91c33a4cb83bd5a070efa9d0778b11d8a44e37445190","citations":["euclid-6-4","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as the straight line AB is to BF, so is FB to BN; [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] therefore the rectangle AB, BN is equal to the square on BF. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,按比例,直线AB至BF的比等于FB至BN的比;因此,矩形至AB、BN的比等于BF和BF的比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb34a1e9970506d500b020d05336d0c79788ae03eaf7e3ec2ea57e0140cd4535","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AL is equal to LK, while LN is common and at right angles, therefore the base KN is equal to the base AN; [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)] therefore the angle LKN is also equal to the angle LAN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于AL等于LK,而LN是普通的,因此直角,底边,KN等于底边,AN;因此,角度LKN也等于角度LAN。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c1602e79d703b0081a25d1b8d74adef033d63f8e49b30bb3b5e391a6b3398f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle LAN is equal to the angle KBN; therefore the angle LKN is also equal to the angle KBN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但LAN角等于KBN角,因此LKN角也等于KBN角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c88d3312695d166cdd29463405f34b90eea000e1d81441a8fc9d814427c4744","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the angle at A is common to the two triangles AKB and AKN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A角角是AKB和AKN三角的常见角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce573dc980cb6f99a475346ca501339b26c97b0d30578d3d7272d0880325863d","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the remaining angle AKB is equal to the remaining angle KNA; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the triangle KBA is equiangular with the triangle KNA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余的角AKB等于其余角KNA;因此三角形KBA是三角形KNA的等角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b3c281d9e3ce6502d9b47f14a75671fa6604632ad9b25e8a624d3799788dc42","citations":["euclid-6-4","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as the straight line BA is to AK, so is KA to AN; [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] therefore the rectangle BA, AN is equal to the square on AK. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,按比例,直线BA至AK的比等于KA至AN的比;因此,矩形至BA、AN的比等于AK和AK的比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07da4912ec34fae1f448c27d9979e9f25da9d1934799213b2fd657efc4bae14f","citations":["euclid-2-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AB, BN was also proved equal to the square on BF; therefore the rectangle AB, BN together with the rectangle BA, AN, that is, the square on BA [[II. 2](/principles/euclid-2-2)], is equal to the square on BF together with the square on AK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,矩形 AB,BN也证明等于BF的正方形;因此,矩形 AB,BN与矩形 BA,AN,即BA,正方形等于BF的正方形,AK,正方形等于正方形。 [[II. 2](/principles/euclid-2-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c608ab9cdca93f817825697996d6ef4ff33293cbc8326e30889799e3a6d8ac06","citations":["euclid-4-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And BA is a side of the pentagon, BF of the hexagon [[IV. 15, Por.](/principles/euclid-4-15)], and AK of the decagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA是五角形的一面, BF是六角形, AK是十角形。 [[IV. 15, Por.](/principles/euclid-4-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":25,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-10.source","contentId":"euclid-13-10","revisionId":"euclid-13-10@raw-1c6916636efefb4d","order":26,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"872a6f21791403441f03e4c76d82a95ce002e1958e49cea833bfef1f6f136d02","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id"